Dataset — th1nhng0/vietnamese-legal-documents
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://huggingface.co/datasets/th1nhng0/vietnamese-legal-documents
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Revision used: 8977887f17be2defae4c5171d55562e1cde7d695 (crawled from vbpl.vn,
refreshed 2026-07-23). Changes made by CustomsVN: documents are parsed into
articles, clauses and points, filtered by force status and subject, tiered by
relevance to customs, chunked and indexed for retrieval.

Weekly updates: CustomsVN runs the crawler published with this dataset
(crawler/ at the same revision) against vbpl.vn, and merges the documents
in its scope with the dataset's own upsert script into a new local revision
(see docs/crawl.md). The crawler is downloaded at build time, not
redistributed here.

The same dataset's legacy_metadata and legacy_content configs ("an older,
larger crawl snapshot", same revision and licence) fill consolidated texts
(VBHN) whose page at vbpl.vn is empty. `customsvn prep` uses them by default;
`-legacy=false` turns it off. The dataset does not document which site that
older crawl came from. Chunks built from it carry "text_source": "legacy_content".

